# Presence of this file makes S44ap start the SoftAP on every boot.
# Shipped present so a freshly flashed card is reachable over WiFi with no
# serial cable and no hand-provisioning: SSID f1c200s-ap, board at
# 192.168.9.1, DHCP leases from 192.168.9.10-.50.
#
# `ap off` removes it (and leaves the ESP32 transport up for wireless Android
# Auto and Bluetooth); `ap on` puts it back. STA mode is mutually exclusive --
# `wifi on` clears this flag, because both modes share the single wlan0.
#
# The passphrase is public; see the header of /etc/hostapd.conf for what that
# does and does not expose.
